  m_Text: "C\u1EDD T\u1EF7 Ph\xFA RPG\nBoard game chi\u1EBFn thu\u1EADt theo l\u01B0\u1EE3t, b\xE0n c\u1EDD 3D low poly 32 \xF4, t\u1ED1i \u0111a 4 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi (Bot ho\u1EB7c nhi\u1EC1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t m\xE1y).\n\nL\xE0m b\u1EB1ng Unity 6 (URP).\nModel, icon, giao di\u1EC7n, \xE2m thanh: Kenney (CC0).\nFont: Be Vietnam Pro (SIL OFL)."
